  "description": "Rendezvous and docking system design: the mechanical interfaces, capture latches, and probe-and-drogue or androgynous peripheral mechanisms that join two spacecraft in orbit. Covers APAS-95 and IDA international docking system standards, Soyuz-style probe-cone soft capture, the impact attenuation and structural hard capture latches, and the sensor and relative navigation gear that closes the final metres of approach.",
